prompt_template:
Create ONE finished {ASPECT_RATIO} premium sports campaign image. This is a faithful photographic and compositional transfer of the following language: {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
SUBJECT: {SUBJECT}
CAPTURED STATE: {STATE}
The ONLY written words are exactly "{WORDMARK}". Stack the first word above the second in heavy compact italic title-case white lettering. Make this ORIGINAL LOGO: {LOGO}. Place the white symbol immediately left of the two-line wordmark, tightly joined as ONE prominent tightly joined lockup at the photograph optical center. Do not separate the symbol from the words. The white group must read strongly at first glance and overlap the lower cheek/chin and upper body; it is not a small label below the face. The photograph continues fully behind the group.
Use the layout plan matching the requested output ratio only. 9:16 plan: {PORTRAIT_LAYOUT}. 16:9 plan: {LANDSCAPE_LAYOUT}.
Build a moody underexposed sunlit atmosphere with warm amber highlights, substantial natural shadow, muted blue sky/water and gentle bloom on wet highlights. Focus sharply only on the nearer eye and a small nearby skin plane; let the very near arm/hand, some droplets, farther shoulder and background dissolve with clearly visible optical softness. Keep real skin and water tactile while lowering digital microcontrast; avoid an evenly sharp clinical result. No digital effects, pixel blocks, colored gels, synthetic gradient background, extra type or side copy panel. Source details to replace: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
